    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #303\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses the four test-coverage gaps flagged on merged PRs #97, #101, and #103, as described in issue #273:\n\n- **`web/src/api/__tests__/httpGenericOperations.test.ts`**: `linkItem`'s test now asserts the POST body (`{ targetItemId }`), and `unlinkItem`'s bodyless `DELETE` is asserted to carry no body.\n- **`backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/inboxPipeline.test.ts`**: the seed-idempotency test now asserts `inboxItemTypes` and `processingProposals` counts stay at 1 after a second `seedSystem` call, not just `inbox`.\n- **`backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/inboxTick.test.ts`**: `capturingTickRegistry` now validates `actionConfig` through the production `semprecTickActionConfigSchema` instead of casting, with a new direct test asserting it rejects a malformed config (missing/non-UUID `inboxDatabaseId`) the same way production does. A new test also covers queue-affinity routing on the `update` and `soft-delete` `onItemEvent` paths, previously asserted only for `create`.\n- **`backend/packages/data/src/inbox/inboxTickAction.ts`**: exported `semprecTickActionConfigSchema` (the only production-code change permitted by the issue) so the test double can validate against the real schema.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm test` in `web/` — 75 tests / 8 files passed\n- [x] `pnpm test` in `backend/` — 315 tests / 24 files passed\n\nBranch: `bb/relay-273-review-debt-08-12-close-the-test-cover-thr_sdai2vfbvx` (pushed to origin).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
